; An amount inferred from a cost (#1692) is tested for zero and printed
; at one precision: the commodity's, widened to the precision of the cost
; when the commodity's stored precision is 0 or the amount would round to
; zero at it.  Once a later amount teaches the commodity a precision that
; shows the inferred amount, that precision governs.  The inferred
; amounts here are negative and positive, below and above one unit.

2018-01-01 * Foo
    Assets:A                    2 X @ 0.2 Y
    Assets:B

2018-02-01 * Bar
    Assets:C                   -2 M @ 0.0002 N
    Assets:D

2018-03-01 * Baz
    Assets:E                    1.25 Y
    Assets:F                   -1.25 Y

2018-04-01 * Qux
    Assets:G                    3 X @ 0.123 Y
    Assets:H

test bal
                -2 M
             N0.0004
                 5 X
             -0.77 Y  Assets
                 2 X    A
             -0.40 Y    B
                -2 M    C
             N0.0004    D
              1.25 Y    E
             -1.25 Y    F
                 3 X    G
             -0.37 Y    H
--------------------
                -2 M
             N0.0004
                 5 X
             -0.77 Y
end test

test reg Assets:B Assets:D Assets:H
18-Jan-01 Foo                   Assets:B                    -0.40 Y      -0.40 Y
18-Feb-01 Bar                   Assets:D                    N0.0004      N0.0004
                                                                         -0.40 Y
18-Apr-01 Qux                   Assets:H                    -0.37 Y      N0.0004
                                                                         -0.77 Y
end test
